c c DIRECT: 3-coloring of 5 vertices, 5 edges: counted
c c DIRECT: ^c s exact arb int 30$
c c FALLBACK: over budget, counting normally
c c FALLBACK: ^c s exact arb int 30$
c c NORMAL-NOT: \[color\]
c c NORMAL: ^c s exact arb int 30$
